  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Slice pumpkin and red onion into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil. Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e68a5a49c635d8a589b/step-30eec800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato, cucumber and roasted almonds.\n• Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e68a5a49c635d8a589b/step-9cc82110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, apple, spinach & rocket mix, basil pesto and a drizzle of vinegar. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e68a5a49c635d8a589b/step-a6d94020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide basil pesto salad between bowls.\n• Top with roast pumpkin, haloumi and onion.\n• Sprinkle with almonds and crumble over marinated goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e68a5a49c635d8a589b/step-51df7b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
